<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8621" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήκουστ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be heard, inaudible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				421b5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unheard of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤκουσ᾽ ἀνήκουστα . . ὥστε φρῖξαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					1407
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				363
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of
			prayers, <i>not to be granted,</i> Antiph<i><span class="en">
				01.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>not willing to hear</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>”
				<i>disobedience,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					3.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
